y-followup/TESTS-R21.json">TESTS-R21.json</a></li><li><a href="../../../../tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/owner-inventory-followup/TEST-MATRIX-R21.json">TEST-MATRIX-R21.json</a></li><li><a href="../../../../tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/owner-inventory-followup/COMMANDS-R21.json">COMMANDS-R21.json</a></li><li><a href="../../../../tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/owner-inventory-followup/BROWSER-PDF-R21.json">BROWSER-PDF-R21.json</a></li><li><a href="../../../../tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/owner-inventory-followup/PDF-INSPECTION-R21.json">PDF-INSPECTION-R21.json</a></li><li><a href="../../../../tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/owner-inventory-followup/PRESERVATION-R21.json">PRESERVATION-R21.json</a></li><li><a href="../../../../tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/owner-inventory-followup/CHANGED-FILES-R21.json">CHANGED-FILES-R21.json</a></li><li><a href="../../../../tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/owner-inventory-followup/ARTIFACT-INVENTORY.json">ARTIFACT-INVENTORY.json</a></li></ul><p>23张截图／逐页图 21.59MiB；新验证PDF合计19份 172.78MiB。保留人审期产物，不自动清理或归档。</p><h2>仍需闭环</h2><ol><li>PE批准BODY可读取路径。</li><li>ECR SEC05／07和Ziwei SEC08公开读取。</li><li>BaZi原BODY资源可用性。</li><li>ECR正式正文与固定章的owner对应、双语同源绑定，以及完整Ziwei候选。</li><li>Human视觉接受、较大私有PDF交付准入及单独生产授权。</li></ol><p>零Provider／付款／退款／生产D1或R2写入／Stripe修改／commit／push／deploy。没有历史客户报告迁移。</p><!-- R22-SUCCESSOR-BEGIN --><div id="REPORT-VISUAL-ASSET-CONVERGENCE-R2-2"><h3>R2.2 · Asset recovery and private PDF delivery / 资产恢复与私有交付</h3><p><strong>LOCAL HUMAN_REVIEW_READY_WITH_BLOCKERS · PARTIAL</strong>。本节追加在 R2.1 内；旧回执与旧结论保留为历史，不将其当作当前通过。</p><p>Zi Wei：完整原生候选已实际生成并检查68页（15固定＋53 BODY），最后页背景及两页英文7px溢出已最小修复；桌面1440/手机390无横向溢出。BaZi：原生动态检查PASS；真实BODY可读，三语言四页背景诊断通过，诊断不等于完整客户报告。PE BODY与ECR SEC05/07仍404。</p><table><tr><th>Report</th><th>Exact key / URL</th><th>HTTP / bytes</th><th>Cause / repair</th><th>Four independent gates</th></tr><tr><td>PROFILE</td>