ain exact mapping; no guessed fallback.</td><td>Mapping PASS<br>Public BLOCKED<br>PDF BLOCKED_COMPLETE_REPORT<br>Private BLOCKED</td></tr><tr><td>ZWR</td><td><code>images/reports/ziwei/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-ZIWEI-SEC-08-PRESSURE-VULNERABILITY.webp</code><br><a href="https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/ziwei/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-ZIWEI-SEC-08-PRESSURE-VULNERABILITY.webp">https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/ziwei/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-ZIWEI-SEC-08-PRESSURE-VULNERABILITY.webp</a></td><td>404 → 200<br>529302 bytes</td><td>Now readable at identical approved key; Last-Modified 2026-10-26 11:52:21Z. Prior delivery failure cause not proven.<br>Activate exact verified SEC08 in existing manifest; add approved BODY to native closing; reduce R2 English top whitespace 9mm→6mm. No copy/font-size changes.</td><td>Mapping PASS<br>Public PASS<br>PDF PASS_LOCAL_68_PAGES<br>Private BLOCKED</td></tr><tr><td>BZR</td><td><code>images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp</code><br><a href="https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp">https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp</a></td><td>旧诊断URL无效，撤回 → 200<br>225290 bytes</td><td>Prior R21 body-read.mjs prepended public base to an already absolute approved URL; exact native configured URL reads 200. Product URL unchanged.<br>Correct diagnostic classification only; existing native mapping retained.</td><td>Mapping PASS<br>Public PASS<br>PDF PASS_BODY_DIAGNOSTIC_ONLY_NATIVE_DYNAMIC_REGRESSION_PASS<br>Private BLOCKED</td></tr></table><p>URL公共基址由现有 resolver/registry固定；未发现可据此改绑的已验证替代URL。未读取管理凭证，未重试旧401。三个404均无Location、Age、CF-Cache-Status，带查询参数仍404：不证明不存在，也不证明需要purge。对象清单权威保留为 Owner Dashboard transcription，当前独立对象管理验证仍缺。</p><h4>实际PDF与画面</h4><ul><li><a href="/output/pdf/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/r22/bazi-body-diagnostic-bilingual.pdf">bazi-body-diagnostic-bilingual.pdf</a>：4页，1441639 bytes；BODY逐页栅格失败0。<a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r22/bazi-body-diagnostic-bilingual-pages.png">全页缩略图</a></li><li><a href="/output/pdf/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/r22/bazi-body-diagnostic-en.pdf">bazi-body-diagnostic-en.pdf</a>：4页，1403603 bytes；BODY逐页栅格失败0。<a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r22/bazi-body-diagnostic-en-pages.png">全页缩略图</a></li><li><a href="/output/pdf/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/r22/bazi-body-diagnostic-zh-Hans.pdf">bazi-body-diagnostic-zh-Hans.pdf</a>：4页，1456750 bytes；BODY逐页栅格失败0。<a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r22/bazi-body-diagnostic-zh-Hans-pages.png">全页缩略图</a></li><li><a href="/output/pdf/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/r22/ziwei-native-fixed-and-body.pdf">ziwei-native-fixed-and-body.pdf</a>：68页，44198197 bytes；BODY逐页栅格失败0。<a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r22/ziwei-native-fixed-and-body-pages.png">全页缩略图</a></li></ul><p>Zi Wei完整性仅指现有批准内容的本地原生渲染；未授予客户发布/语义新增接受。BaZi四页合成诊断明确标注，不替代原生报告。AST原64页及PE15固定页、ECR三语言BODY证据按文件SHA复用，未重造或改写页数。</p><h4>私有交付：BLOCKED</h4><p>11项实际安全检查：已有真实小PDF（83,527 bytes）经现有加密runtime_artifacts保存、15分钟账户绑定header grant、重复下载字节一致、错误账户/过期/来源撤销拒绝、失败恢复；大PDF通过真实renderer响应交给原helper后，被1MiB guard正确拒绝且不留下半成品。没有放宽上限，也没有把个人PDF放入公开R2。</p><p>现有PRIVATE_REPORTS绑定可供已批准released-report owner使用，但它依赖其原有release/consent/专业报告投影，并非本轮PE视觉PDF的已准入写入通道。R2模板亦需与LOCAL-PDF-R1.2缓存身份隔离。Workers官方限制为128MB/isolate，响应body无固定上限；当前arrayBuffer→base64→加密/JSON多副本不能凭文件小于128MB就判定安全。需复用现有私有owner完成流式/大文件、权限撤销、并发内存和故障恢复的本地等效证明，才可改为PRIVATE_DELIVERY_PASS。</p><p><a href="https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/platform/limits/">Workers官方限制</a> · <a href="https://developers.cloudflare.com/r2/platform/limits/">R2官方限制</a>。R2单对象容量并非目前阻断；应用1MiB guard与尚未准入的集成才是当前阻断。</p><h4>测试与源码</h4><p>183项R22、44接收、120项R1.2隔离复跑与BaZi动态回归通过；既有66项浏览器/11小PDF的未受影响证据按摘要复用。Functions编译结果见下方运行记录，不使用整站build替代视觉验收。</p><p>继承runner恢复历史输出时发生UNKNOWN文件错误；七份生成证据文件变化已隔离列出。后获明确限定授权，逐份确认仅为运行时间／合成reading ID变化，备份并恢复至本轮开始的HEAD准确字节：7/7恢复、0跳过。原自动审批拒绝记录保留为历史。原历史测试与冻结hash未改。第二次120项运行将所有输出写入隔离目录，成功且不覆盖旧回执。</p><ul><li><a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r22/ASSET-DELIVERY-MATRIX.json">ASSET-DELIVERY-MATRIX.json</a></li><li><a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r22/PUBLIC-DIAGNOSTICS.json">PUBLIC-DIAGNOSTICS.json</a></li><li><a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r22/PRIVATE-DELIVERY.json">PRIVATE-DELIVERY.json</a></li><li><a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r22/PDF-INSPECTION-R22.json">PDF-INSPECTION-R22.json</a></li><li><a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r22/BROWSER-PDF-R22.json">BROWSER-PDF-R22.json</a></li><li><a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r22/TESTS-R22.json">TESTS-R22.json</a></li><li><a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r22/R22-SOURCE-CHANGES.json">R22-SOURCE-CHANGES.json</a></li><li><a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r22/REUSED-PDF-EVIDENCE.json">REUSED-PDF-EVIDENCE.json</a></li><li><a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r22/PRESERVATION.json">PRESERVATION.json</a></li><li><a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r22/RECEIPT-RECOVERY-STATUS.json">RECEIPT-RECOVERY-STATUS.json</a></li><li><a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r22/CURRENT-WORKTREE.log">CURRENT-WORKTREE.log</a></li><li><a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r22/EXECUTION-STATE.md">EXECUTION-STATE.md</a></li><li><a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r22/VERIFIED-SOURCE.json">VERIFIED-SOURCE.json</a></li><li><a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r22/r12-regression/LOCAL-TESTS.json">r12-regression/LOCAL-TESTS.json</a></li></ul><h4>后续精确关卡</h4><ol><li>PE已批准BODY、ECR两个精确key：由现有bucket authority读取对象详情及public-domain association，确认大小/摘要/大小写；若域名指向错误才提出有before/after的配置patch。当前未证明具体配置错误，不提出盲改、重传或purge。</li><li>ECR既有双语sourceProjection关系与新固定章节对应仍需内容owner证据；不按同坐标擅自合并。</li><li>复用PRIVATE_REPORTS及原权限/release owner的受控大PDF适配、模板身份及内存/流式验收；没有批准前继续BLOCKED。</li><li>七份回归生成证据恢复已完成并逐份校验；其他窗口新增修改继续保留。</li></ol><p>R2写/删0；生产配置变更0；生产D1写0；READ_ONLY移除0；Provider 0 / USD0；付款/退款0/0；commit/push/deploy均0。</p></div><p>证据恢复闭环：<a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r22/authorized-receipt-recovery/AUDIT.json">七份文件、起始状态、前后SHA及差异</a> · <a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r22/authorized-receipt-recovery/RESULT.json">7/7精确恢复结果</a> · <a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r22/authorized-receipt-recovery/BEFORE-DIFFS.log">恢复前逐文件diff</a>。备份及HEAD字节保留在同一 authorized-receipt-recovery 目录；不涉及产品源码，未重跑未受影响测试。</p><!-- R22-SUCCESSOR-END --><!-- R23-SUCCESSOR-BEGIN --><div id="REPORT-VISUAL-ASSET-CONVERGENCE-R2-3"><h3>R2.3 · 新 BODY 与大文件私有交付本地候选</h3><p><strong>LOCAL_HUMAN_REVIEW_READY_WITH_BLOCKERS · PARTIAL</strong>。沿用R2.2；七份证据恢复保持7/7原字节。没有发布或销售授权。</p><table><tr><th>Gate</th><th>当前结论</th></tr><tr><td>A 视觉资源读取</td><td>PE新BODY PASS；ECR SEC05/07当前仍404，PARTIAL。</td></tr><tr><td>B 实际PDF</td><td>PE中英双语三份PASS_LOCAL；ECR三语言完整合成均BLOCKED，不用旧图替换。</td></tr><tr><td>C 大文件私有交付</td><td>PASS_LOCAL_NODE_AND_NATIVE_WORKERD；35项Node/权限检查＋6项原生本地workerd检查通过；真实账户接线/商业外部关卡BLOCKED。</td></tr><tr><td>D 商业生产</td><td>NOT_AUTHORIZED / NOT_PROVEN。</td></tr></table><h4>三张资源的当前实测</h4><table><tr><th>资源</th><th>精确key及URL</th><th>前→后</th><th>大小 / SHA / 解码</th></tr><tr><td>PROFILE BODY</td><td><code>images/reports/personal-evidence/VIS-REPORT-PROFILE-BODY.webp</code><br><a href="https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/personal-evidence/VIS-REPORT-PROFILE-BODY.webp">实际测试URL</a></td><td>R22 404 → R23 200</td><td>371800 bytes；1055×1491<br><code>287d3c5c7a64a4d9eacb6e2b4e9be8f017348b6564bf3c97e7a76e8b0d4e6074</code>；真实解码并查看</td></tr><tr><td>ECR SEC-05</td><td><code>images/reports/ecr/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-ECR-SEC-05-REALITY-GRAMMAR-QUESTIONS.webp</code><br><a href="https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/ecr/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-ECR-SEC-05-REALITY-GRAMMAR-QUESTIONS.webp">实际测试URL</a></td><td>R22 404 → R23 404</td><td>OWNER_DASHBOARD_CONFIRMED_API_UNVERIFIED；当前不能核实图内语法</td></tr><tr><td>ECR SEC-07</td><td><code>images/reports/ecr/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-ECR-SEC-07-CARRIER-ENVIRONMENT.webp</code><br><a href="https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/ecr/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-ECR-SEC-07-CARRIER-ENVIRONMENT.webp">实际测试URL</a></td><td>R22 404 → R23 404</td><td>OWNER_DASHBOARD_CONFIRMED_API_UNVERIFIED；当前不能核实图内语法</td></tr></table><p>PE BODY改为本次明确批准的 personal-evidence 路径，稳定?v=SHA固定版本，不使用随机查询。ECR文件名保持原样；普通GET及两种只读查询仍404，同目录BODY对照200。响应无Age/CF-Cache-Status/Location证明缓存或跳转错误；不推断对象不存在，也不证明需要purge。未访问或续期管理凭证。下一步是核实这两个精确key的对象详情和public association，或提供Dashboard实际公开链接；未执行任何配置变更。</p><h4>实际PDF：先看客户画面</h4><ul><li><a href="/output/pdf/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/r23/profile-bilingual.pdf">profile-bilingual.pdf</a>：25页＝15固定＋10 BODY；49529553 bytes。<a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r23/profile-bilingual-pages.png">全页画面</a></li><li><a href="/output/pdf/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/r23/profile-en.pdf">profile-en.pdf</a>：21页＝15固定＋6 BODY；49446831 bytes。<a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r23/profile-en-pages.png">全页画面</a></li><li><a href="/output/pdf/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/r23/profile-zh.pdf">profile-zh.pdf</a>：21页＝15固定＋6 BODY；49508684 bytes。<a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r23/profile-zh-pages.png">全页画面</a></li></ul><p>经现有root/account中间件的合成JWE会话执行保存→建报告→重开；三语言采用相同15张双语固定图片，动态标签/选中原始资料随所选语言，客户自述不自动翻译。固定页仅一个contain图像、没有动态覆盖。22张BODY物理页全部栅格核对通过，包括首次/中段/跨页/末段；1440与390无横向溢出。合成字段明确不代表真实客户事实，疏页不补造内容。</p><p><a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r23/final-profile-1440.png">桌面代表性画面</a> · <a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r23/final-profile-390.png">390px代表性画面</a>。ECR三语言新完整PDF均未生成：两个必需资源不可读，既有内容关联门槛保留；另一个窗口的ECR语义更新未在本轮接受或覆盖。以前三语言BODY摘页证据保留且不冒充本轮完整PDF。AST64页、Zi Wei68页及BaZi动态/BODY结果按SHA保留。</p><h4>大PDF：实际实现与边界</h4><p>新增现有账户owner的本地child adapter，复用身份normalizer、dossierEligibility、加密runtime_artifacts元数据、PRIVATE_REPORTS接口及DAR签名。旧1MiB内嵌base64 guard原样保留；完整文件不再进入该小文件路径。选用经身份验证的流式代理，15分钟header grant；没有公开永久链接或客户端R2凭证。</p><p>本地实际传输83,527、1,403,603及49,446,831 bytes文件，完整及重复下载SHA相符；处理块最大64KiB，未调用object.arrayBuffer。范围/续传、HEAD、另一账户、另一报告、不同语言/来源、会员撤销、来源撤销、签名过期/篡改、输入中断、输出截断、错误摘要和明确重试均已测试。撤销只保证新请求重新拒绝，不能收回下载副本或承诺中止已开始传输。</p><p><strong>尚未接入客户正式下载路由。</strong> 先完成文件流适配器/既有权限模块检查，再以Miniflare原生workerd的隔离本地D1/R2运行同一模块：49,446,831 bytes上传校验、原生FixedLengthStream、完整及重复下载SHA、条件Range、另一身份拒绝、来源撤销共6项PASS。这不是实际Cloudflare账户或生产等效证明；真实binding/renderer可信摘要、客户来源/同意与retention cleanup接线、内存/并发和正式认证入口仍需现有owner完成。C不是商业放行。</p><p><a href="https://developers.cloudflare.com/r2/api/workers/workers-api-reference/">R2官方流/摘要/Range接口</a> · <a href="https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/platform/limits/">Workers官方限制</a>。1MiB是现有应用guard，不是平台PDF上限；128MB内存和无固定response-body上限也不能代替实际内存验收。</p><h4>工程证据与接续</h4><p>44项本轮资产/合成检查、35项流式权限/完整性检查通过；13个JS入口独立bundle与Functions编译PASS，297项依赖无漂移。沿用未受影响的120/44/183等历史检查；未为了重复计数重跑它们。</p><ul><li><a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r23/GATE-MATRIX.json">GATE-MATRIX.json</a></li><li><a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r23/PUBLIC-READS.json">PUBLIC-READS.json</a></li><li><a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r23/ECR-CACHE-DIAGNOSTICS.json">ECR-CACHE-DIAGNOSTICS.json</a></li><li><a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r23/ECR-POSITIVE-CONTROL.json">ECR-POSITIVE-CONTROL.json</a></li><li><a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r23/PDF-INSPECTION-R23.json">PDF-INSPECTION-R23.json</a></li><li><a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r23/BROWSER-PDF-R23.json">BROWSER-PDF-R23.json</a></li><li><a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r23/TARGETED-TESTS.json">TARGETED-TESTS.json</a></li><li><a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r23/LARGE-PRIVATE-DELIVERY-TESTS.json">LARGE-PRIVATE-DELIVERY-TESTS.json</a></li><li><a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r23/PRIVATE-DELIVERY-ARCHITECTURE.md">PRIVATE-DELIVERY-ARCHITECTURE.md</a></li><li><a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r23/R23-SOURCE-CHANGES.json">R23-SOURCE-CHANGES.json</a></li><li><a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r23/R23-INCREMENTAL-SOURCE.log">R23-INCREMENTAL-SOURCE.log</a></li><li><a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r23/CURRENT-WORKTREE.log">CURRENT-WORKTREE.log</a></li><li><a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r23/VERIFIED-SOURCE.json">VERIFIED-SOURCE.json</a></li><li><a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r23/PRESERVATION.json">PRESERVATION.json</a></li><li><a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r23/CHECKPOINT.json">CHECKPOINT.json</a></li><li><a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r23/EXECUTION-STATE.md">EXECUTION-STATE.md</a></li></ul><p>R2写/删除、生产cache purge、生产D1写、Stripe修改、Provider调用/费用、commit/push/deploy均为0。保留并行HD、Finance、BaZi及其他工作。</p></div><p>新增原生本地证据：<a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r23/NATIVE-RUNTIME-TESTS.json">6项workerd/D1/R2检查</a>。只使用Miniflare本地存储，未访问生产D1/R2。HEAD由并行窗口从c5851dd86618522b0a1bd92465be3ee9ee37214d推进至df8111d6e59e23b3805b6817c92de18ff5cfa72e；本轮未创建提交，实际候选以依赖SHA摘要识别。</p><!-- R23-SUCCESSOR-END --><!-- R24-SUCCESSOR-BEGIN --><div id="REPORT-VISUAL-ASSET-CONVERGENCE-R2-4"><h3>R2.4 · ECR证据与私有PDF本地接线</h3><p><strong>LOCAL_PARTIAL_WITH_SPECIFIC_BLOCKERS</strong>。本轮完成可执行的本地工作；不能宣称ECR完整PDF、生产存储或商业放行。</p><table><tr><th>Gate</th><th>结论</th></tr><tr><td>A ECR资源</td><td>BLOCKED：SEC05/07实际GET仍404，图像字节/SHA/解码未验证；ROOT_CAUSE_UNCONFIRMED。</td></tr><tr><td>B ECR完整PDF</td><td>BLOCKED：不补造或替换缺图，未生成本轮完整ECR PDF；原内容/locale关联证据仍需核实。</td></tr><tr><td>C 私有存储接线</td><td>PARTIAL：现有账户路由＋合成私有存储PASS_LOCAL；实际外部账户/renderer/bucket配置UNVERIFIED。</td></tr><tr><td>D 并发与生命周期</td><td>PASS_LOCAL_MEASURED：36/36完整下载，32项账户/生命周期，35项流式回归及120项原R1.2回归通过。</td></tr><tr><td>E 生产商业</td><td>NOT_AUTHORIZED / NOT_READY。</td></tr></table><h4>ECR精确404诊断</h4><p>两个批准key保持原样：<code>images/reports/ecr/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-ECR-SEC-05-REALITY-GRAMMAR-QUESTIONS.webp</code> 与 <code>images/reports/ecr/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-ECR-SEC-07-CARRIER-ENVIRONMENT.webp</code>。R23→R24均为404；普通GET、带no-cache查询均未取得图片。同目录BODY为200。没有Age/ETag/CF-Cache-Status/Location证明缓存或重定向原因，不把404判成对象不存在。</p><p>线上public-asset-config为503，表示公开base配置缺失或无效；它不解释直接r2.dev请求的404。<a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r24/ECR-ROOT-CAUSE.json">精确URL、时间与响应</a> · <a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r24/LIVE-PUBLIC-CONFIG.json">独立配置观察</a>。未purge、未改名、未上传。无新ECR PDF；保留原PE三语言、AST、Zi Wei及BaZi证据。</p><h4>私有交付流程与实际操作</h4><ol><li>现有root/account身份、明确同意及报告来源/权益检查。</li><li>可信renderer输出stream＋大小＋摘要，PRIVATE_REPORTS保存完整文件；现有加密元数据只保存引用。</li><li>重开由相同owner重新核权、签发15分钟header grant；不重新生成、不调用模型。</li><li>每次流式读取再核身份、权益、来源、报告、语言及摘要；过期/撤销后拒绝新读取。</li><li>来源retention owner确认真正过期→dry-run→tombstone→对象删除→CAS元数据清理；失败保留可重试状态。</li></ol><p>本地真实接口：POST <code>/api/account-profile-evidence?lane=experiences</code>，action <code>prepare-private-pdf</code>；GET同一路径带report、language、format=private-pdf，要求合成账户session及DAR Authorization header。只在受控本地合成环境启用，production环境拒绝。不存在公开报告URL、客户端R2密钥或平行权限系统。</p><p>32项实测涵盖约49MB读取、重复下载/授权无需重渲染、匿名/另一账户/错报告/未知字段/无同意拒绝、过期、会员撤销、来源失效、删除故障重试和orphan隔离。Renderer使用既有真实PDF的流式测试替身；不是本轮新报告正文渲染。原生workerd存储/传输与账户路由分别验证，不声称两者已在外部生产环境合并验收。</p><h4>实际并发与内存</h4><table><tr><th>并发</th><th>完成</th><th>批次总耗时</th><th>Node / workerd进程峰值</th></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>1/1; 0失败</td><td>2.40秒</td><td>233.4 / 188.3 MiB</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>5/5; 0失败</td><td>12.37秒</td><td>235.2 / 247.8 MiB</td></tr><tr><td>10</td><td>10/10; 0失败</td><td>16.00秒</td><td>244.5 / 278.4 MiB</td></tr><tr><td>20</td><td>20/20; 0失败</td><td>32.26秒</td><td>248.7 / 340.3 MiB</td></tr></table><p>每次49,446,831 bytes，SHA均为586882ec8a99506bc2c834f3ed3c8df822bbfd4a294aa69e8414f097c0d52be3。耗时为批次总时间。内存为50ms进程工作集采样，非单个isolate heap，不能证明生产128MB约束。完整结果包含单请求耗时、进程树采样、断线重读和负测。</p><h4>保留与清理</h4><p>下载grant过期、会员取消、退款权益拒绝或来源撤销不等于删除成品。实际来源保存期到期才可清理；有效成品保留，默认dry-run。孤儿仅限本地、同一owner、24小时以上、确实无元数据引用的对象；外来/未知/新建/被撤销runtime仍引用的文件不删除。没有生产cron或生产删除。</p><h4>源码、证据与下一步</h4><p>本轮产品变更仅现有账户owner、large child及新增lifecycle child；旧1MiB路径保持原字节。HEAD df8111d6e59e23b3805b6817c92de18ff5cfa72e；未提交源码摘要 <code>447e6620a2e4cc8a97fd4113791d629c7090ae73a2a434cfe02a1705490eaf39</code>（298依赖），不可用HEAD单独代表已验证dirty候选。保留并行ECR、HD、BaZi及其他窗口修改。</p><ul><li><a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r24/GATE-MATRIX.json">GATE-MATRIX.json</a></li><li><a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r24/R24-SOURCE-CHANGES.json">R24-SOURCE-CHANGES.json</a></li><li><a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r24/CURRENT-SOURCE-DIFF.log">CURRENT-SOURCE-DIFF.log</a></li><li><a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r24/GIT-STATUS.log">GIT-STATUS.log</a></li><li><a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r24/VERIFIED-SOURCE.json">VERIFIED-SOURCE.json</a></li><li><a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r24/FUNCTIONS-BUILD.log">FUNCTIONS-BUILD.log</a></li><li><a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r24/INTEGRATION-LIFECYCLE-TESTS.json">INTEGRATION-LIFECYCLE-TESTS.json</a></li><li><a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r24/LARGE-PRIVATE-DELIVERY-TESTS.json">LARGE-PRIVATE-DELIVERY-TESTS.json</a></li><li><a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r24/r12-regression-command.json">r12-regression-command.json</a></li><li><a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r24/CONCURRENCY-RESULTS.json">CONCURRENCY-RESULTS.json</a></li><li><a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r24/PROCESS-MEMORY.json">PROCESS-MEMORY.json</a></li><li><a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r24/PRIVATE-INTEGRATION-CONFIG.md">PRIVATE-INTEGRATION-CONFIG.md</a></li><li><a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r24/RETAINED-PDFS.json">RETAINED-PDFS.json</a></li><li><a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r24/PRESERVATION.json">PRESERVATION.json</a></li><li><a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r24/CHECKPOINT.json">CHECKPOINT.json</a></li><li><a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r24/EXECUTION-STATE.md">EXECUTION-STATE.md</a></li></ul><p>下一步：批准的只读对象详情/实际public URL以核实ECR两个key；现有renderer owner接纳HTML流与可信长度/摘要契约；核实实际PRIVATE_REPORTS账户绑定/权限及生产准入。现有METHOD_REPORT_RENDERER的/verify JSON不能直接冒充/pdf HTML接口。当前模块明确拒绝production，不能仅翻转开关上线。</p><p>自动审批拒绝读取本地Wrangler OAuth凭证的fallback；未执行该凭证读取，未绕过。公开诊断与全部独立本地工程已完成。R2/D1生产写、cache purge、Stripe修改、Provider调用/费用、付款/退款、commit/push/deploy均0；READ_ONLY保持。</p></div><!-- R24-SUCCESSOR-END --></section><!-- REPORT-VISUAL-CONVERGENCE-R21:END --><!-- REPORT-VISUAL-ASSET-CONVERGENCE-R2:BEGIN --><section id="REPORT-VISUAL-ASSET-CONVERGENCE-R2" class="rvac"><style>.rvac{padding:24px;background:#f5f1e8;color:#17333e;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.rvac *{box-sizing:border-box}.rvac a{color:#086773}.rvac-table{max-width:100%;overflow:auto}.rvac table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse}.rvac th,.rvac td{padding:9px;border:1px solid #b9ad8a;text-align:left}.rvac-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(240px,100%),1fr));gap:12px}.rvac img{max-width:100%;height:auto}.rvac figure{margin:0}.rvac code{overflow-wrap:anywhere}</style><h1>REPORT-VISUAL-ASSET-CONVERGENCE-R2</h1><p>2026-10-26 · <strong>PARTIAL · HUMAN REVIEW</strong>。本地候选，未上线。固定图稿语言、客户内容语言与章节模式已分离。</p><p>报告内容按照您选择的语言生成；Personal Evidence 与 PHI Configuration 的封面及固定章节页统一采用中英双语版本。<br>Report content follows your selected language. Covers and fixed section pages for Personal Evidence and PHI Configuration use the shared bilingual edition.</p><h2>八类报告</h2><div class="rvac-table"><table><thead><tr><th>Report</th><th>Master sections</th><th>Fixed language</th><th>Readiness</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>BZR</td><td>DYNAMIC</td><td>MATCH_APPROVED_LANGUAGE_VARIANT</td><td>VERIFIED</td></tr><tr><td>AST</td><td>FIXED</td><td>MATCH_APPROVED_LANGUAGE_VARIANT</td><td>BLOCKED</td></tr><tr><td>ZWR</td><td>FIXED</td><td>MATCH_APPROVED_LANGUAGE_VARIANT</td><td>BLOCKED</td></tr><tr><td>PROFILE</td><td>FIXED</td><td>BILINGUAL_SHARED</td><td>BLOCKED</td></tr><tr><td>ECR</td><td>FIXED</td><td>BILINGUAL_SHARED</td><td>BLOCKED</td></tr><tr><td>NUM</td><td>FIXED</td><td>MATCH_APPROVED_LANGUAGE_VARIANT</td><td>PENDING</td></tr><tr><td>HD</td><td>FIXED</td><td>MATCH_APPROVED_LANGUAGE_VARIANT</td><td>PENDING</td></tr><tr><td>CROSS</td><td>FIXED</td><td>MATCH_APPROVED_LANGUAGE_VARIANT</td><td>PENDING</td></tr></tbody></table></div><h2>实际 R2 核对</h2><p>认证列举返回 HTTP401，完整清单仍 BLOCKED；没有续期或创建凭证。另核对81个现有登记精确key：46个解码成功、35个404。公共GET不是完整清单；404也不是新版本不存在的证明。</p><p>Personal Evidence旧目录全部失效，尚未找到新六页；ECR仅P01–P05确认，第六页与固定章节顺序未确认。AST有8张新字节匹配已知章节身份，旧SEC07/08地址404；Ziwei仅一张章首已确认，旧owner的S01/S02映射相互冲突。没有猜新文件名、复制双语对象、重建单语版本或更改历史冻结hash。</p><h2>实际 PDF 局部样张</h2><p><strong>以下是实际渲染的已确认页面子集，不是完整报告，不以标题中的“完整报告”图内文字宣称交付完成。</strong>固定页没有运行时标题、正文、数值、图表、客户姓名或页脚叠加；contain保持原比例。ECR客户正文样本复用原生合成报告owner，另页呈现。手机密集固定图内文字仍需放大，人审可读性尚待接受