vergence-r2/phi-configuration-zh-Hans-pages.png"><img loading="lazy" src="../../../../tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/phi-configuration-zh-Hans-pages.png" alt="实际PDF逐页 phi-configuration-zh-Hans"></a><figcaption>phi-configuration-zh-Hans · 真实PDF页面缩略</figcaption></figure><figure><a href="../../../../tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/phi-configuration-bilingual-pages.png"><img loading="lazy" src="../../../../tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/phi-configuration-bilingual-pages.png" alt="实际PDF逐页 phi-configuration-bilingual"></a><figcaption>phi-configuration-bilingual · 真实PDF页面缩略</figcaption></figure></div><h2>中英桌面与390px</h2><div class="rvac-grid"><figure><a href="../../../../tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/final-phi-configuration-en-1440.png"><img loading="lazy" src="../../../../tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/final-phi-configuration-en-1440.png" alt="final-phi-configuration-en-1440.png"></a><figcaption>final-phi-configuration-en-1440.png</figcaption></figure><figure><a href="../../../../tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/final-phi-configuration-en-390.png"><img loading="lazy" src="../../../../tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/final-phi-configuration-en-390.png" alt="final-phi-configuration-en-390.png"></a><figcaption>final-phi-configuration-en-390.png</figcaption></figure><figure><a href="../../../../tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/final-phi-configuration-zh-Hans-1440.png"><img loading="lazy" src="../../../../tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/final-phi-configuration-zh-Hans-1440.png" alt="final-phi-configuration-zh-Hans-1440.png"></a><figcaption>final-phi-configuration-zh-Hans-1440.png</figcaption></figure><figure><a href="../../../../tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/final-phi-configuration-zh-Hans-390.png"><img loading="lazy" src="../../../../tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/final-phi-configuration-zh-Hans-390.png" alt="final-phi-configuration-zh-Hans-390.png"></a><figcaption>final-phi-configuration-zh-Hans-390.png</figcaption></figure></div><h2>实际检查</h2><p>51项有界契约及负测通过，既有Profile120项回归、八字动态章节和package aliases通过，11项相关模块编译及实际Pages Functions Worker编译通过。五份PDF共37页；全部为局部样张。没有以这些结果替代20项完整验收。</p><div class="rvac-table"><table><thead><tr><th>Test</th><th>Status</th><th>Actual boundary</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>T01</td><td>PASS</td><td>All eight architecture policies tested</td></tr><tr><td>T02</td><td>PASS</td><td>Existing BaZi dynamic publication test exits0; source/bindings unchanged</td></tr><tr><td>T03</td><td>BLOCKED</td><td>AST eight confirmed image-only masters pass; SEC07/08 missing, full candidate blocked</td></tr><tr><td>T04</td><td>BLOCKED</td><td>Ziwei one confirmed master rendered; S01/S02 ownership/order unresolved; others old404</td></tr><tr><td>T05</td><td>BLOCKED</td><td>PROFILE Chinese source-content path retained; six real bilingual fixed pages not located</td></tr><tr><td>T06</td><td>BLOCKED</td><td>PROFILE English same; authenticated R2 request409 stores no incomplete artifact</td></tr><tr><td>T07</td><td>BLOCKED</td><td>PROFILE bilingual same; no fabricated PDF</td></tr><tr><td>T08</td><td>BLOCKED</td><td>ECR Chinese partial sample real; sixth page/section sequence absent</td></tr><tr><td>T09</td><td>BLOCKED</td><td>ECR English partial sample real; same five fixed asset keys</td></tr><tr><td>T10</td><td>BLOCKED</td><td>ECR bilingual comparison sample real, not a saved report; source locale binding also unresolved</td></tr><tr><td>T11</td><td>BLOCKED</td><td>ECR same confirmed keys across three modes passes; PROFILE policy passes but actual keys unavailable</td></tr><tr><td>T12</td><td>BLOCKED</td><td>Neither required six-page sequence has been proven; no invented P06</td></tr><tr><td>T13</td><td>PASS</td><td>All confirmed masters image-only; injected body ignored; content separated in unit contract; full completion not implied</td></tr><tr><td>T14</td><td>PASS</td><td>Missing/invalid/unapproved resources fail closed; no generated fallback</td></tr><tr><td>T15</td><td>PASS</td><td>NUM/HD/CROSS pending even though existing preliminary artwork exists</td></tr><tr><td>T16</td><td>PASS</td><td>Existing language policies retained; AST/Ziwei no unapproved locale fallback; BaZi regression passes</td></tr><tr><td>T17</td><td>BLOCKED</td><td>Five partial PDFs37pages pass A4/decode/no cropping; complete report visual acceptance remains blocked</td></tr><tr><td>T18</td><td>PASS</td><td>Commercial registry/prices/cost/entitlements byte-identical to HEAD</td></tr><tr><td>T19</td><td>BLOCKED</td><td>Relevant11 modules and actual Pages Functions build pass; full static npm build:pages NOT_RUN to protect shared dirty generation workflow</td></tr><tr><td>T20</td><td>PASS</td><td>Execution read-only cloud GET and local only; all mutation/provider/payment counters0</td></tr></tbody></table></div><h2>工程证据与接续</h2><p>branch main；HEAD c5851dd86618522b0a1bd92465be3ee9ee37214d；实际未提交源码摘要 <code>1c2e1a9de2b53836895e4359b88bcc77fc0da146f329fa24b8ecd40c9d8b5c02</code>，295项依赖。原主审阅内容及并行修改保留，不运行会覆盖整个master的生成脚本。</p><ul><li><a href="../../../../tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/IMPLEMENTATION-NOTES.md">IMPLEMENTATION-NOTES.md</a></li><li><a href="../../../../tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/DISCOVERY-MATRIX.json">DISCOVERY-MATRIX.json</a></li><li><a href="../../../../tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/PUBLIC-OBJECT-READS.json">PUBLIC-OBJECT-READS.json</a></li><li><a href="../../../../tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/R2-INVENTORY-FAILURE.json">R2-INVENTORY-FAILURE.json</a></li><li><a href="../../../../tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/ARCHITECTURE-MATRIX.json">ARCHITECTURE-MATRIX.json</a></li><li><a href="../../../../tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/T01-T20.json">T01-T20.json</a></li><li><a href="../../../../tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/TESTS.jso