lor:#17333e;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.rvac *{box-sizing:border-box}.rvac a{color:#086773}.rvac-table{max-width:100%;overflow:auto}.rvac table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse}.rvac th,.rvac td{padding:9px;border:1px solid #b9ad8a;text-align:left}.rvac-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(240px,100%),1fr));gap:12px}.rvac img{max-width:100%;height:auto}.rvac figure{margin:0}.rvac code{overflow-wrap:anywhere}</style><h1>REPORT-VISUAL-ASSET-CONVERGENCE-R2</h1><p>2026-10-26 · <strong>PARTIAL · HUMAN REVIEW</strong>。本地候选，未上线。固定图稿语言、客户内容语言与章节模式已分离。</p><p>报告内容按照您选择的语言生成；Personal Evidence 与 PHI Configuration 的封面及固定章节页统一采用中英双语版本。<br>Report content follows your selected language. Covers and fixed section pages for Personal Evidence and PHI Configuration use the shared bilingual edition.</p><h2>八类报告</h2><div class="rvac-table"><table><thead><tr><th>Report</th><th>Master sections</th><th>Fixed language</th><th>Readiness</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>BZR</td><td>DYNAMIC</td><td>MATCH_APPROVED_LANGUAGE_VARIANT</td><td>VERIFIED</td></tr><tr><td>AST</td><td>FIXED</td><td>MATCH_APPROVED_LANGUAGE_VARIANT</td><td>BLOCKED</td></tr><tr><td>ZWR</td><td>FIXED</td><td>MATCH_APPROVED_LANGUAGE_VARIANT</td><td>BLOCKED</td></tr><tr><td>PROFILE</td><td>FIXED</td><td>BILINGUAL_SHARED</td><td>BLOCKED</td></tr><tr><td>ECR</td><td>FIXED</td><td>BILINGUAL_SHARED</td><td>BLOCKED</td></tr><tr><td>NUM</td><td>FIXED</td><td>MATCH_APPROVED_LANGUAGE_VARIANT</td><td>PENDING</td></tr><tr><td>HD</td><td>FIXED</td><td>MATCH_APPROVED_LANGUAGE_VARIANT</td><td>PENDING</td></tr><tr><td>CROSS</td><td>FIXED</td><td>MATCH_APPROVED_LANGUAGE_VARIANT</td><td>PENDING</td></tr></tbody></table></div><h2>实际 R2 核对</h2><p>认证列举返回 HTTP401，完整清单仍 BLOCKED；没有续期或创建凭证。另核对81个现有登记精确key：46个解码成功、35个404。公共GET不是完整清单；404也不是新版本不存在的证明。</p><p>Personal Evidence旧目录全部失效，尚未找到新六页；ECR仅P01–P05确认，第六页与固定章节顺序未确认。AST有8张新字节匹配已知章节身份，旧SEC07/08地址404；Ziwei仅一张章首已确认，旧owner的S01/S02映射相互冲突。没有猜新文件名、复制双语对象、重建单语版本或更改历史冻结hash。</p><h2>实际 PDF 局部样张</h2><p><strong>以下是实际渲染的已确认页面子集，不是完整报告，不以标题中的“完整报告”图内文字宣称交付完成。</strong>固定页没有运行时标题、正文、数值、图表、客户姓名或页脚叠加；contain保持原比例。ECR客户正文样本复用原生合成报告owner，另页呈现。手机密集固定图内文字仍需放大，人审可读性尚待接受。</p><ul><li><a href="../../../../output/pdf/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/astrology-confirmed-pages.pdf">astrology-confirmed-pages · PDF</a> — 13张固定图；完整报告 = NO</li><li><a href="../../../../output/pdf/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/ziwei-confirmed-pages.pdf">ziwei-confirmed-pages · PDF</a> — 6张固定图；完整报告 = NO</li><li><a href="../../../../output/pdf/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/phi-configuration-en.pdf">phi-configuration-en · PDF</a> — 5张固定图；完整报告 = NO</li><li><a href="../../../../output/pdf/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/phi-configuration-zh-Hans.pdf">phi-configuration-zh-Hans · PDF</a> — 5张固定图；完整报告 = NO</li><li><a href="../../../../output/pdf/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/phi-configuration-bilingual.pdf">phi-configuration-bilingual · PDF</a> — 5张固定图；完整报告 = NO</li></ul><p>Personal Evidence：未生成假图或替代PDF，保持BLOCKED。两类“前六页”均未宣称通过。ECR中英投影ID不同，缺同源绑定时不会合并成持久化双语客户报告。</p><div class="rvac-grid"><figure><a href="../../../../tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/astrology-confirmed-pages-pages.png"><img loading="lazy" src="../../../../tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/astrology-confirmed-pages-pages.png" alt="实际PDF逐页 astrology-confirmed-pages"></a><figcaption>astrology-confirmed-pages · 真实PDF页面缩略</figcaption></figure><figure><a href="../../../../tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/ziwei-confirmed-pages-pages.png"><img loading="lazy" src="../../../../tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/ziwei-confirmed-pages-pages.png" alt="实际PDF逐页 ziwei-confirmed-pages"></a><figcaption>ziwei-confirmed-pages · 真实PDF页面缩略</figcaption></figure><figure><a href="../../../../tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/phi-configuration-en-pages.png"><img loading="lazy" src="../../../../tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/phi-configuration-en-pages