质量通过。</p><h3>一次性发布步骤与剩余事项</h3><table><tr><th>类别</th><th>具体工作</th></tr><tr><td>已完成</td><td>Current dispatcher remains closed; prior scoped UI and isolated service evidence inherited<br>Row-level metadata read and per-record disposition for currently accessible D1 records<br>19→20→21 synthetic isolated schema/data-preservation rehearsal<br>Actual API source packs and generation/review contract frozen; provider calls zero<br>Relevant build identity rechecked without unrelated rebuild</td></tr><tr><td>需要实现</td><td>Resolve historical purchase/invoice/refill/refund and cost/reservation lineage before any credit import<br>Promote checksum-bound migration candidates only after active prerequisite mapping and governance acceptance<br>Prove prior binary credit-reader compatibility before allowing rollback execution; safe immediate rollback is read-only<br>Profile/Financial complete released report material binding; Relationship accepted private report producer/reader remains absent</td></tr><tr><td>需要付费模型验证</td><td>Current prompts + auto-review: repaired Book II Chinese, Book VII English, new supported partial task, one synthetic inference reject<br>Current permission/rates must be reverified; candidate USD0.04 cap is not yet a reserved authorization</td></tr><tr><td>需要生产操作授权</td><td>Exact prerequisite migrations and candidates19–21<br>Same validated Worker plus complete shared configuration after P9 compatibility audit<br>Legacy/new routing cutover and limited commercial activation after all gates</td></tr></table><p>首批候选仅获准片段的普通 Knowledge。Profile／Financial仍为材料预览，Relationship关闭；跨册长文、实时研究和个人导航均未取得完整交付准入。七册逐册准确章节／版本／缺口见原范围清单，不能宣传七册全面问答。</p><p>回滚先关闭两种执行，保留现行授权读取和所有新账务；不清表、不恢复旧余额、不重发权益。完整执行前条件、后检查及恢复步骤均在下方机器可读包。</p><p><a href="/tools/review/membership-ask-credit-r1/PRE-RELEASE-CLOSURE.json">同一产物发布收尾包</a> · <a href="/tools/review/membership-ask-credit-r1/HISTORICAL-BALANCE-ROW-RECONCILIATION.json">逐条对账</a> · <a href="/tools/review/membership-ask-credit-r1/MIGRATION-19-21-ISOLATED