>Gate A–E分别审阅</h3><table><tr><th>阶段</th><th>实际结果</th></tr><tr><td>A 来源</td><td>PARTIAL：实际60页身份与现有引用/单元已核对；逐段第三方原作归属、原始版页码与商业权限仍有缺口。</td></tr><tr><td>B 历史拆解</td><td>60/60物理页映射完成；固定教育、条件解释、整合、Cross插页、医学/预测风险、过时商业与邻接方法已分开。不是第三方权利清除。</td></tr><tr><td>C 17节条件契约</td><td>本地候选完成，优先SEC07/09/10/15；全部保持publicationAllowed=false。</td></tr><tr><td>D Cross试点</td><td>PRIVATE_REVIEW_ONLY：计算排列、历史名称、未核实正式名、书本叙述与可选现实观察分离。没有导入192篇或近义改写。</td></tr><tr><td>E 写作接续</td><td>AUTHORING_HANDOFF_READY_WITH_GAPS；只交四个优先模块的写作包，不生成完整报告语料。</td></tr></table><h3>实际来源版本</h3><p>60页，46,029,354 bytes，PDF作者元数据Teresa Lee；SHA <code>aa098c40b641711f30bd50bdfc316f420c8beaceff4a53a3e3a6b4439c442b0f</code>。PDF作者元数据只证明文件标记，不能证明每段文字、图表、图标或拼合图的权利。原58页版本身份见来源矩阵，两者没有互相覆盖。</p><table><tr><th>现有来源族</th><th>单元</th><th>边界</th></tr><tr><td>HD-PRO-R3-W10-definition-integration-corpus-v1.json</td><td>5</td><td>既有双语候选；source admission / semantic admission / rights / publication分别核对。R6未批准商用。</td></tr><tr><td>HD-PRO-R3-W11-variable-phs-professional-meaning-corpus-v1.json</td><td>54</td><td>既有双语候选；source admission / semantic admission / rights / publication分别核对。R6未批准商用。</td></tr><tr><td>HD-PRO-R3-W4-type-professional-meaning-corpus-v1.json</td><td>5</td><td>既有双语候选；source admission / semantic admission / rights / publication分别核对。R6未批准商用。</td></tr><tr><td>HD-PRO-R3-W5-authority-professional-meaning-corpus-v1.json</td><td>8</td><td>既有双语候选；source admission / semantic admission / rights / publication分别核对。R6未批准商用。</td></tr><tr><td>HD-PRO-R3-W6-profile-professional-meaning-corpus-v1.json</td><td>12</td><td>既有双语候选；source admission / semantic admission / rights / publication分别核对。R6未批准商用。</td></tr><tr><td>HD-PRO-R3-W7-center-professional-meaning-corpus-v1.json</td><td>27</td><td>既有双语候选；source admission / semantic admission / rights / publication分别核对。R6未批准商用。</td></tr><tr><td>HD-PRO-R3-W8-channel-professional-meaning-corpus-v1.json</td><td>36</td><td>既有双语候选；source admission / semantic admission / rights / publication分别核对。R6未批准商用。</td></tr><tr><td>HD-PRO-R3-W9-gate-professional-meaning-corpus-v1.json</td><td>64</td><td>既有双语候选；source admission / semantic admission / rights / publication分别核对。R6未批准商用。</td></tr></table><p>来源/权限主证据：<a href="/tools/review/hd-r6/SOURCE-LINEAGE-MATRIX.json">SOURCE-LINEAGE-MATRIX.json</a> · <a href="/tools/review/hd-r6/RIGHTS-REVIEW-MATRIX.json">RIGHTS-REVIEW-MATRIX.json</a> · <a href="/tools/review/hd-r6/REPOSITORY-REFERENCE-INVENTORY.json">REPOSITORY-REFERENCE-INVENTORY.json</a> · <a href="/tools/review/hd-r6/PRIVATE-SOURCE-IDENTITY.json">60页身份与逐页计数（无原文）</a>。</p><h3>历史60页的取舍</h3><table><tr><th>物理页</th><th>观察与处理</th></tr><tr><td>1–7</td><td>封面、说明与图示；仅结构参考，个人身份和旧图不复制。</td></tr><tr><td>8–17、21–22</td><td>类型、权威、定义、中心、通道、角色的条件化范例；逐值、来源、权利与现实边界需分别审阅。</td></tr><tr><td>18–20</td><td>Godheads/等分、PHI OS视觉对照与个人Cross插页不能混为同一种权威；p20只作私有Cross试点。</td></tr><tr><td>23–27</td><td>PHS/Color/Tone/环境；历史健康与饮食因果主张不进入生产解释。</td></tr><tr><td>28–42</td><td>Astrology、Gene Keys、DreamRave排除出HD核心；不可因在旧报告中出现便自动接纳。</td></tr><tr><td>43–56</td><td>BG5及行星/爻线整合；保留专家组织经验，逐条审查第三方衍生、财富/命运结论与组合规则。</td></tr><tr><td>57–60</td><td>练习可作原创候选；旧定价、代理、联系方式和付款指令隔离，不作当前Commerce规则。</td></tr></table><p><a href="/tools/review/hd-r6/LEGACY-TO-17-SECTION-MAPPING.json">完整60页→17节映射</a>。关键词风险标记只是筛查线索，映射为Codex审查候选，不称Human ACCEPT。</p><h3>17节条件内容范围</h3><table><tr><th>节</th><th>候选模块/缺口</th><th>选择与边界</th></tr><tr><td>SEC01 Architecture</td><td>0既有候选；MISSING_VALUE_SPECIFIC_AUTHORING</td><td>Use one same-version chart snapshot; display facts without personality conclusions.</td></tr><tr><td>SEC02 TypeStrategy</td><td>5既有候选；PARTIAL_EXISTING_MODULES_AUTHORING_SCOPE_OPEN</td><td>Exact canonicalType==chart.typeCode; strategy must use same type owner.</td></tr><tr><td>SEC03 Authority</td><td>8既有候选；PARTIAL_EXISTING_MODULES_AUTHORING_SCOPE_OPEN</td><td>Exact canonicalAuthority==chart.authority; authority outranks generic gate suggestions.</td></tr><tr><td>SEC04 Definition</td><td>5既有候选；PARTIAL_EXISTING_MODULES_AUTHORING_SCOPE_OPEN</td><td>Exact definition code and connected components; no inferred psychological incompleteness.</td></tr><tr><td>SEC05 Centers</td><td>27既有候选；PARTIAL_EXISTING_MODULES_AUTHORING_SCOPE_OPEN</td><td>Select per center DEFINED / UNDEFINED_WITH_ACTIVATION / OPEN_NO_ACTIVATION; never conflate.</td></tr><tr><td>SEC06 Channels</td><td>36既有候选；PARTIAL_EXISTING_MODULES_AUTHORING_SCOPE_OPEN</td><td>Both Gates active and channel present; complete channel outranks duplicate isolated gate narrative.</td></tr><tr><td>SEC07 Gates ★</td><td>64既有候选；PARTIAL_EXISTING_MODULES_AUTHORING_SCOPE_OPEN</td><td>Match each activation by side+planet+Gate+Line; gate-level corpus is not a64x6 line corpus.</td></tr><tr><td>SEC08 Profile</td><td>12既有候选；PARTIAL_EXISTING_MODULES_AUTHORING_SCOPE_OPEN</td><td>Profile code equals Personality Sun line / Design Sun line; do not infer age events.</td></tr><tr><td>SEC09 Cross ★</td><td>0既有候选；MISSING_VALUE_SPECIFIC_AUTHORING</td><td>Ordered Personality Sun/Earth + Design Sun/Earth; verified name additionally requires exact angle/profile/variant registry evidence.</td></tr><tr><td>SEC10 Variables ★</td><td>18既有候选；PARTIAL_EXISTING_MODULES_AUTHORING_SCOPE_OPEN</td><td>Select admitted axis+Color+orientation only; Tone/cognition/PHS rule not implied by matching arrows.</td></tr><tr><td>SEC11 Environment</td><td>24既有候选；PARTIAL_EXISTING_MODULES_AUTHORING_SCOPE_OPEN</td><td>Separate design-lower environment from personality-lower perspective and personality-upper motivation; no fusion.</td></tr><tr><td>SEC12 Relationship</td><td>0既有候选；MISSING_VALUE_SPECIFIC_AUTHORING</td><td>Single-chart observation questions only; partner/composite claim requires separate confirmed partner input and existing relationship owner.</td></tr><tr><td>SEC13 Career</td><td>0既有候选；MISSING_VALUE_SPECIFIC_AUTHORING</td><td>Optional real work constraints; no BG5 professional claims or promised suitability.</td></tr><tr><td>SEC14 Resources</td><td>0既有候选；MISSING_VALUE_SPECIFIC_AUTHORING</td><td>Optional resource decisions; no wealth, investment return or financial competence inferred from chart.</td></tr><tr><td>SEC15 Integration ★</td><td>0既有候选；MISSING_VALUE_SPECIFIC_AUTHORING</td><td>Only signed same-snapshot, admitted value-specific rules; preserve hierarchy and contradictions; no narrative interpolation.</td></tr><tr><td>SEC16 Reality</td><td>0既有候选；MISSING_VALUE_SPECIFIC_AUTHORING</td><td>Use optional explicitly supplied observations, keep user assertion separate; no invented events.</td></tr><tr><td>SEC17 Practice</td><td>0既有候选；MISSING_VALUE_SPECIFIC_AUTHORING</td><td>Offer reversible observation questions only; no therapy or compulsory decision instruction.</td></tr></table><p>★ 优先写作。<a href="/tools/review/hd-r6/SECTION-CONTRACTS.json">SECTION-CONTRACTS.json</a>包含每节必需计算字段、精确模块ID、来源、权限、优先级、冲突、缺失和双语状态。<a href="/tools/review/hd-r6/CONDITIONAL-CONTENT-SCHEMA.json">CONDITIONAL-CONTENT-SCHEMA.json</a>是可运行本地审查schema，不是第二套生产发布owner。现有Line/Tone争议、PHS/cognition缺口、整合准入与图像权威均保留。</p><h3>私有Cross试点：分开六层</h3><ol><li>计算：有序43/23|29/30；只继承现有本地计算身份，不新宣称天文精度。</li><li>名称：p20存在历史名称；verifiedName仍null，没有以常识或书名补齐。</li><li>解释：Gate23/29/30/43候选源ID可定位；这不等于已有完整Cross主题。</li><li>书籍叙述：Chetan Parkyn单著与其和Carola Eastwood合著分开登记；不假定p20必然来自某本书。</li><li>现实：没有用户新观察，保持空记录；不伪造事件、行动或结果。</li><li>双语：只准备独立问题框架和缺口说明，不把历史长文翻译或近义改写。</li></ol><p>中文示例：作出一项投入决定前，你掌握了哪些条件，还缺什么？<br>English: Before committing to an activity, what conditions were known and what remained uncertain?</p><p><a href="/tools/review/hd-r6/INCARNATION-CROSS-PILOT.json">INCARNATION-CROSS-PILOT.json</a> · <a href="https://newworldlibrary.com/product/the-book-of-destinies">出版社：The Book of Destinies（两位作者、192主题的书目证据）</a> · <a href="https://newworldlibrary.com/product/human-design">出版社：Human Design（Chetan Parkyn）</a>。书目确认不是PHIOS的复用许可。</p><h3>交付与Owner下一步</h3><ul><li><a href="/tools/review/hd-r6/SOURCE-LINEAGE-MATRIX.json">SOURCE-LINEAGE-MATRIX.json</a></li><li><a href="/tools/review/hd-r6/RIGHTS-REVIEW-MATRIX.json">RIGHTS-REVIEW-MATRIX.json</a></li><li><a 